n.Grind.CommRing.Poly.maxDegreeOf_k","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Init/Grind/Ring/FieldSolver.lean#L269-L271"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Grind/Ring/FieldSolver.html#Lean.Grind.CommRing.Poly.toPolyQ\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">CommRing</span>.<span class=\"name\">Poly</span>.<span class=\"name\">toPolyQ</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">p</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Grind/Ring/CommSolver.html#Lean.Grind.CommRing.Poly\">Poly</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">invs</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Grind/Ring/FieldSolver.html#Lean.Grind.CommRing.InvVars\">InvVars</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">ainvs</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Grind/Ring/FieldSolver.html#Lean.Grind.CommRing.InvAtoms\">InvAtoms</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Grind/Ring/FieldSolver.html#Lean.Grind.CommRing.PolyQ\">PolyQ</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Cancels the inverse pairs of `ainvs`, eliminates the numeral inverses of `invs`, and reduces\nthe result to lowest terms.","docLink":"./Init/Grind/Ring/FieldSolver.html#Lean.Grind.CommRing.Poly.toPolyQ","kind":"def","line":260,"name":"Lean.Grind.CommRing.Poly.toPolyQ","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Init/Grind/Ring/FieldSolver.lean#L260-L265"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Grind/Ring/FieldSolver.html#Lean.Grind.CommRing.PolyQ.reduce\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">CommRing</span>.<span class=\"name\">PolyQ</span>.<span class=\"name\">reduce</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">q</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Grind/Ring/FieldSolver.html#Lean.Grind.CommRing.PolyQ\">PolyQ</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Grind/Ring/FieldSolver.html#Lean.Grind.CommRing.PolyQ\">PolyQ</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Lowest terms: divides `num` and `den` by their greatest common factor. The divisions are\nchecked by multiplying back, so the correctness proof needs no divisibility reasoning.","docLink":"./Init/Grind/Ring/FieldSolver.html#Lean.Grind.CommRing.PolyQ.reduce","kind":"def","line":249,"name":"Lean.Grind.CommRing.PolyQ.reduce","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Init/Grind/Ring/FieldSolver.lean#L249-L258"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Grind/Ring/FieldSolver.html#Lean.Grind.CommRing.PolyQ.substInv\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">CommRing</span>.<span class=\"name\">PolyQ</span>.<span class=\"name\">substInv</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">q</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Grind/Ring/FieldSolver.html#Lean.Grind.CommRing.PolyQ\">PolyQ</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">x</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Grind/Ring/CommSolver.html#Lean.Grind.CommRing.Var\">Var</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">c</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Grind/Ring/FieldSolver.html#Lean.Grind.CommRing.PolyQ\">PolyQ</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Init/Grind/Ring/FieldSolver.html#Lean.Grind.CommRing.PolyQ.substInv","kind":"def","line":245,"name":"Lean.Grind.CommRing.PolyQ.substInv","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Init/Grind/Ring/FieldSolver.lean#L245-L247"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Grind/Ring/FieldSolver.html#Lean.Grind.CommRing.Poly.substInv\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">CommRing</span>.<span class=\"name\">Poly</span>.<span class=\"name\">substInv</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">p</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Grind/Ring/CommSolver.html#Lean.Grind.CommRing.Poly\">Poly</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">x</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Grind/Ring/CommSolver.html#Lean.Grind.CommRing.Var\">Var</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">c</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Grind/Ring/FieldSolver.html#Lean.Grind.CommRing.PolyQ\">PolyQ</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Eliminates the variable `x`, which denotes `c⁻¹`, from `p`: the polynomial is multiplied by\n`c ^ n`, where `n` is the maximal degree of `x` in `p`, so that every power `x ^ k` can be\ncancelled against the coefficient (`c ^ k * x ^ k = 1`); the denominator is `c ^ n`.\n`c = 0` is not an inverse and is left alone.","docLink":"./Init/Grind/Ring/FieldSolver.html#Lean.Grind.CommRing.Poly.substInv","kind":"def","line":234,"name":"Lean.Grind.CommRing.Poly.substInv","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Init/Grind/Ring/FieldSolver.lean#L234-L243"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_